  "summary": "Malicious code in rollup-plugin-polyfill-hold (npm)",
  "details": "The package exports functions (getPlugin, setPlugin, getPluginExten) that fetch JSON from hxxps://rest-icon-handler[.]store/icons/ and pass the response body to eval(), executing arbitrary remote code. The C2 host is rest-icon-handler[.]store, accessed via paths /icons/103 and /icons/389. The package is a combosquat on the legitimate rollup-plugin-polyfill name with \"hold\" appended, and its described purpose as a CDN icon fetcher is a cover for the remote code execution behaviour.",
